# q2-usbtrace trace format (docs/internals.md#usb-tracer), built from a device log for test/unit/test_usb_fsm.py.
# Source: q2-usb-2.log, 2026-11-22, a computer's cable in through two Standbys (demo ms as s; demo's clock does not
# run in a suspend, the wall time says how long it slept). First: the link kept (udc configured at standby, wake and
# wake+5s). Second: the link down at the standby and the wake (conn=disconn, udc not_attached), configured again by
# wake+5s (4032.425): a host that answers only seconds after the wake.
541.000000 start
541.000000 s PD17=0 PD18=1 PC20=0 on=1 dev=0
541.000000 udc configured
541.393000 wake slept=88.000
541.393000 s PD17=0 PD18=1 PC20=0 on=1 dev=0
541.393000 udc configured
546.917000 s conn=connect
4027.273000 udc not_attached
4027.374000 wake slept=57.000
4027.374000 s PD17=0 PD18=1 PC20=0 on=1 dev=0
4027.374000 udc not_attached
4032.425000 udc configured
